ty\")))\n    # Cast timestamp\n    .withColumn(\"signup_timestamp\", to_timestamp(col(\"signup_timestamp\"), \"yyyy-MM-dd'T'HH:mm:ss'Z'\"))\n    # Hash PII fields (SSN masked at Silver)\n    .withColumn(\"ssn_hash\", sha2(concat(col(\"ssn\"), col(\"user_id\")), 256))\n    .drop(\"ssn\")\n    # Null handling\n    .fillna({\n        \"full_name\": \"UNKNOWN\",\n        \"email\": \"unknown@unknown.com\",\n        \"city\": \"UNKNOWN\",\n        \"status\": \"PENDING\"\n    })\n    # Validate status\n    .withColumn(\"status\", \n        when(col(\"status\").isin(\"ACTIVE\", \"INACTIVE\", \"SUSPENDED\"), col(\"status\"))\n        .otherwise(\"UNKNOWN\")\n    )\n    # Deduplication key\n    .withColumn(\"dedup_key\", col(\"user_id\"))\n)\n\n# Show result\ndf_silver.display()\n```\n\n**Output Schema (Silver Layer):**\n\n| Column | Type | Notes |\n|--------|------|-------|\n| `user_id` | string | Primary key, trimmed |\n| `full_name` | string | Nulls filled with \"UNKNOWN\" |\n| `email` | string | Nulls filled with placeholder |\n| `city` | string | Nulls filled with \"UNKNOWN\" |\n| `status` | string | Validated enum |\n| `signup_timestamp` | timestamp | ISO 8601 parsed |\n| `ssn_hash` | string | SHA-256 hashed (PII masked) |\n| `dedup_key` | string | For deduplication watermark |\n\n---\n\n## 3. Storage & Performance Tuning Recommendations\n\n### Z-Order Configuration\n```sql\n-- Organize data by frequently queried columns for faster scans\nOPTIMIZE silver_users ZORDER BY (user_id, city, signup_timestamp);\n```\n\n### Maintenance Tasks\n```sql\n-- Reorganize and compact small files\nOPTIMIZE silver_users;\n\n-- Remove stale data (older than 7 days)\nVACUUM silver_users RETAIN 168 HOURS;\n```\n\n---\n\n## Summary\n\n- **PII Handling:** The SSN (`999-00-1234`) has been replaced with a SHA-256 hash (`ssn_hash`), complying with PII minimization requirements.\n- **Data Quality:** All string fields are trimmed, timestamps are properly cast, nulls are handled with sensible defaults, and status is validated against allowed values.\n- **Performance:** The suggested Z-Order and maintenance commands will improve query performance and keep the table compact over time.\n\nThe transformed `silver_users` table is now ready for production use with proper PII protection and optimized storage layout."}}
